<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST - Hungary bill, bond yields seen dropping.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Hungary bill, bond yields seen dropping.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian one- and three-month discount treasury bill and two-year government bond yields are expected to drop at this week's auctions, a poll of three dealers showed on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management agency (AKK) will auction one-month treasury bills  HTBM on Tuesday, three-month bills HTBN on Wednesday and two-year 1998/J government bonds  HTBK on Thursday.</p>
<p>			 1-MONTH	   3-MONTH	 1998/J</p>
<p>Amount on offer</p>
<p> (bln forints)     1		   5		  5</p>
<p>Previous average</p>
<p>    (pct)	    22.95(Aug21)   23.02(Aug21)    25.49(Aug1)</p>
<p>Valid bid range</p>
<p>    (pct)	    23.95-20.95    23.52-21.02     23.49-26.00 </p>
<p>	     FORECAST OF HUNGARIAN TRADERS</p>
<p>GYULA KERDO/Creditanstalt Securities</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	  22.79	     22.93	    23.96</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	  22.87	     23.05	    24.70</p>
<p>ZSOLT BANGO/Gog Securities</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	  22.75	     23.05	    23.82</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	  22.90	     23.10	    23.85</p>
<p>KATALIN SOLYMOSI/Postabank Securities</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	  22.93	     22.98	    23.55</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	  22.95	     23.03	    23.80</p>
<p>-- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410</p>
